{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1027749-2e-yantra-for-legacies","id":1027749,"title":"2E Yantra For Legacies","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-01-06T10:40:54-08:00","id":1027749,"title":"2E Yantra For Legacies","content":"Hello, everyone!<br /> <br /> I was wondering if you guys could help me with a few Legacies I was looking to implement in my game. I adapted their Attainments but I do not have their Yantra. Ideally I would like 5 Yantra / Legacy, so to balance things out, but I am having a hard time coming up with them. I guess it is just hard to balance what is symbolic and relevant to the essence of a Legacy with a situation that will come up in game/could be used for spell casting!<br /> <br /> The Legacies:<br /> <br /> Awakening Gambit<br /> <br /> Pure Sovereign<br /> <br /> Fangs of Mara<br /> <br /> Reality Stalkers","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Don't follow me, I'm lost too! But if you do...</b><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/gimmisky/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.deviantart.com/gimmisky/</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/gimmisky/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.instagram.com/gimmisky/</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11263-gimmisky","name":"Gimmisky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11263_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T14:45:34-08:00","id":1027856,"title":"","content":"Awakening Gambit<br /> Game tokens; such as cards, dominoes or chess pieces (+1)<br /> Playing a game as a simulation of reality; such as chess, monopoly or Street Fighter (+2, +1 if it's rushed)<br /> <br /> Pure Sovereigns<br /> Symbols of authority through excellence; such as medals or diplomas (+1)<br /> A personal &quot;Throne Room&quot; (+2)<br /> <br /> Fangs of Mara<br /> Succeeding on an Empathy or Intimidation roll relevant to the spell (+2)<br /> Records of nightmares or trauma; such as paintings, journals or video recordings (+1, +2 if tailored to the spell)<br /> Receiving or inflicting torture (+2)<br /> Mind-altering drugs (+2, +1 without a corresponding condition)<br /> <br /> Reality Stalkers<br /> Succeeding on a Larceny or Stealth roll relevant to the spell (+2)<br /> Equipment for geodesic measurements (+1)<br /> Making occult-mathematical calculations (+1, +2 if they take time)<br /> Ritually prepared passageways (+1, +2 if tailored to the spell)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>~<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">\u266b</span></span>","edited":{"userid":7593,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","user":"Teatime","date":". 01-06-2017, 05:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","name":"Teatime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7593_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-07T04:44:57-08:00","id":1028114,"title":"","content":"I'd like to make a request too...<br /> <br /> Eyes of Ain Soph<br /> Celestial Masters<br /> Liberatores<br /> Forge Masters<br /> Transhuman Engineers","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=925424#post925424\" target=\"_blank\">Simurgh</a>, Mysterium Thyrsus in Mountains of Shadow (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>|<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov","name":"Tambov","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6508_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-07T07:50:46-08:00","id":1028147,"title":"","content":"A funny thing I noticed: Eyes of Ain Soph and Celestial Masters work off similar paradigms. This means that their Yantras will be roughly similar, but their philosophies will differ. That encourages comparing and contrasting them through play. The same can be said of Forge Masters and Transhuman Engineers.<br /> <br /> Eyes of Ain Soph<br /> Succeeding on an Academics or Occult roll relevant to the spell (+2)<br /> Consulting or making occult diagrams (+1, +2 if they take time)<br /> Measuring equipment or dowsing tools (+1)<br /> Altered states of consciousness; through sensory deprivation, ecstatic experiences or mind-altering substances (+2, +1 without a corresponding condition)<br /> <br /> Celestial Masters<br /> Succeeding on an Occult or Science roll relevant to the spell (+2)<br /> Consulting or making occult-science diagrams (+1, +2 if they take time)<br /> Navigation and astrology equipment (+1)<br /> Naturally transformed materials; such as fulgurite, petrified wood, chalk, ash (+1, +2 for rare or extraterrestrial materials)<br /> <br /> Liberatores<br /> Succeeding on a Larceny roll relevant to the Spell (+2)<br /> Succeeding on any social roll to encourage freedom (+2)<br /> Keys to freedom; such as Alcoholics Anonymous Big Book, weapons, keys and metal-cutters, inspiring songs (+1, +2 if tailored to the spell)<br /> Reminders of bondage; such as an empty beer bottle, broken handcuffs, scars from an abusive relationship (+1, +2 if tailored to the spell)<br /> <br /> Forge Masters<br /> Succeeding on a Crafts or Weaponry roll relevant to the spell (+2)<br /> Tools of craft; such as hammers, pliers, anvils, furnaces (+1, +2 for a functional forge)<br /> Self-made handiwork (+1, +2 if tailored to the spell)<br /> Perfected metals (+2)<br /> <br /> Transhuman Engineers<br /> Succeeding on a Science or Crafts roll relevant to the spell (+2)<br /> Meaningful application of technology; anything from a space shuttle lift-off to lighting a small fire (+1, +2 if tailored to the spell)<br /> Personally optimized piece of technology (+1, +2 if tailored to the spell)<br /> Evidence of technology uplifting humanity (+1, +2 if tailored to the spell)<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>~<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">\u266b</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","name":"Teatime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7593_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-05T13:20:17-08:00","id":1058537,"title":"","content":"Any thoughts on the Dreamspeakers and their Yantras?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Don't follow me, I'm lost too! But if you do...</b><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/gimmisky/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.deviantart.com/gimmisky/</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/gimmisky/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.instagram.com/gimmisky/</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11263-gimmisky","name":"Gimmisky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11263_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-05T14:07:54-08:00","id":1058562,"title":"","content":"For the Dreamspeakers, entheogens are a natural +2 Yantra. They also need to make bargains with some of the Dreamborn, so a symbolic representation of whichever Dreamborn they're currently allied with seems a natural thing. Generally driving oneself into an ecstatic frenzy by fire leaping or beating drums probably counts too.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Teatime</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1027749-2e-yantra-for-legacies?p=1027856#post1027856\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Pure Sovereigns<br /> [...]<br /> A personal &quot;Throne Room&quot; (+2)</div> </div> </div> </div>I <i>like</i> that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2855-axelgear","name":"Axelgear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2855_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1450"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-05T14:20:56-08:00","id":1058569,"title":"","content":"Succeeding on an Empathy or Expression roll relevant to the spell (+2)<br /> Music and dancing; anything from rhythmic drumbeat to techno (+1)<br /> Isolation in a sacred place (+1, +2 if it endangers the Dreamspeaker)<br /> Representations of the Dream and Dreamborn (+1, +2 for tokens originating from the Dream, +2 for appropriate body modification)<br /> Altered states of consciousness; through sensory deprivation, ecstatic experiences or mind-altering substances (+2, +1 without a corresponding condition)<br /> <br /> Huh... Apparently I gave them sex, drugs and rock n' roll as Yantras. Also, considering their duty to their communities, the Techne Merit will be prominent.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>~<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">\u266b</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","name":"Teatime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7593_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}